  "实时接入合成事件。这里只展示已到达的数据；离线叙事由事实与规则生成，模型 API 默认锁定。": "ui.evidence_intro",
  "接入数据 / 视频": "ui.sources",
  "数据 → 洞察 → 解说": "sources.pipeline",
  "DATA → INTELLIGENCE → STORY": "sources.pipeline",
  "把比赛接进来。": "sources.title",
  "Bring the match in.": "sources.title",
  "事件流、录像、同一条分析流水线。模型 API 仍由独立授权控制。": "sources.lead",
  "Events and video share one analysis pipeline. Model API access remains separately authorized.": "sources.lead",
  "01 / 事件数据": "sources.events_title",
  "01 / Event data": "sources.events_title",
  "导入符合 MatchLens 格式的 JSONL；比赛从原始事件时钟开始回放。外部实时源可使用 /api/ingest，重复消息不会重复计数。": "sources.events_intro",
  "Import MatchLens JSONL to replay its event clock. Live sources can use /api/ingest; repeated messages are not counted twice.": "sources.events_intro",
  "导入并打开球场": "sources.import",
  "Import and open stadium": "sources.import",
  "02 / 本地视频分析": "sources.video_title",
  "02 / Local video analysis": "sources.video_title",
  "本机预训练模型检测球员与足球，自动追踪和提取事件，不训练模型。自动识别球场标志点，也支持手工校正。视频只发往这台电脑的本地服务。宽视角、连续镜头更适合；遮挡与切镜会中断测量。": "sources.video_intro",
  "Local pretrained models detect players and the ball, track motion and infer events without training. Pitch landmarks are automatic or manually corrected. Video stays on this computer. Wide, continuous shots work best; occlusions and cuts interrupt measurement.": "sources.video_intro",
  "球场标定与身份": "sources.calibration",
  "Pitch calibration and identity": "sources.calibration",
  "默认用预训练关键点模型自动标定。需要手工校正时，在第一帧选择至少四个不共线的球场标志点，并填写对应的 105 × 68 米坐标。点击下方按钮再在画面上取点。只做球场标定，不手工标注传球或射门。": "sources.calibration_intro",
  "Automatic calibration uses pretrained landmarks. For manual correction, choose at least four non-collinear points in the first frame and their corresponding coordinates on a 105 × 68 m pitch. Use the button below to pick points. This calibrates the pitch; it does not label passes or shots.": "sources.calibration_intro",
  "自动标定球场": "sources.auto_pitch",
  "Automatic pitch calibration": "sources.auto_pitch",
  "球场 X": "sources.pitch_x",
  "Pitch X": "sources.pitch_x",
  "球场 Y": "sources.pitch_y",
  "Pitch Y": "sources.pitch_y",
  "在画面上选点": "sources.pick",
  "Pick a point in the frame": "sources.pick",
  "清空标定": "sources.clear",
  "Clear calibration": "sources.clear",
  "也可直接编辑配置。identities 将追踪编号绑定到已知姓名和球衣号；未绑定时显示匿名编号。可提供 team_directions（例如 A:1、U:-1）和 initial_score；未提供时进攻方向和比分均为未确认。方向未确认时不推断射门。切镜后应裁成新片段重新标定。": "sources.identity_help",
  "You can edit the configuration. identities binds track IDs to known names and shirt numbers; unbound tracks stay anonymous. Provide team_directions (for example A:1, U:-1) and initial_score when known. Unknown directions and scores remain unconfirmed; shots are not inferred without direction. Start a new calibrated clip after a camera cut.": "sources.identity_help",
  "device 为 auto 时，Windows 使用 CPU，macOS 使用原有 MPS 配置。": "sources.device_help",
  "With device set to auto, Windows uses CPU and macOS uses its existing MPS configuration.": "sources.device_help",
  "开始本地分析": "sources.run",
  "Start local analysis": "sources.run",
  "停止": "sources.cancel",
  "Stop": "sources.cancel",
  "选择视频后开始；自动标定证据不足时保留缺口，不生成虚构的米制数据。": "sources.initial",
  "Select a video to begin. Insufficient calibration leaves gaps instead of invented metric coordinates.": "sources.initial",
