  "← Pocket Stadium": "sources.back",
  "这个实验使用色彩分类与时序规则，从视频像素估计球员位置、传球、球权变化、射门和球速。输入是视频帧，不读取生成器的事件标签。": "lab.intro",
  "This experiment uses color classification and temporal rules to estimate player positions, passes, possession changes, shots and ball speed from video pixels. It reads frames, not the generator’s event labels.": "lab.intro",
  "适用范围：": "lab.scope_label",
  "Scope:": "lab.scope_label",
  "固定俯视镜头、球场铺满画面（105 × 68 m）、22 种身份色与白球。它是经典视觉基线，不是通用转播视频识别模型；真实转播的遮挡、镜头运动、球衣识别仍需预训练视觉模型接入。": "lab.scope",
  "A fixed overhead view with a full 105 × 68 m pitch, 22 identity colors and a white ball. This is a classical vision baseline; broadcast occlusion, camera motion and shirt recognition require pretrained vision models.": "lab.scope",
  "身份来自预设颜色映射；通过像素中心估计位置，连续两帧近球且球速低于 3 m/s 判定接稳球；最大连通区域抑制编码与抗锯齿的零散色块，持球人之间的自由球运动判定传球。不同队接球记录拦截及球权变化。球速为标定平面内位置差 / 时间差；射门是终场三区至门线区域的轨迹估计，不据此宣称进球。低帧率、失踪或跳帧会重置事件状态，不补造经过。所有输出都标为 classical_vision_estimate。": "lab.method_text",
  "Identity uses preset colors and position uses pixel centers. Reception needs two consecutive near-ball frames with ball speed below 3 m/s. The largest connected region filters encoding noise. Free ball motion between owners indicates a pass; an opponent reception indicates interception and possession change. Speed is planar displacement over time. A shot is a trajectory estimate toward the goal line and does not confirm a goal. Missing or skipped frames reset state without inventing motion. Outputs are labeled classical_vision_estimate.": "lab.method_text",
  "Decoded video frame and detected positions": "aria.decoded_frame"
}
